On Chrome for Android, when a user clicks on a page that triggers an automatic file download, the download notification gets obscured by the Translate notification. This issue occurs because Chrome’s translation feature is activated due to the foreign-language content. As a result, the user may be unaware of the file download, potentially leading to an unintended download of an unwanted file. A proof-of-concept (PoC) video is provided to demonstrate this behavior.

Summary
Download Notification Obscured by Translation Popup, Leading to Undetected File Downloads

Additional Data
Category: Security
Chrome Channel: Not sure
Regression: N/A

