Descriptionch...@google.com created issue on behalf of ki...@gmail.com #1
Apr 20, 2025 12:36AM
Steps to reproduce the problem
Host the HTML I provided and open it in Chrome on Android.
Tap anywhere, and the vulnerability will be triggered. You will notice that the file download notification is covered by the translate notification, which could make the victim unaware that they are downloading a file they did not intend to. To make it clearer, you can watch the PoC video I’ve provided.
Problem Description
On Chrome for Android, when a user clicks on a page that triggers an automatic file download, the download notification gets obscured by the Translate notification. This issue occurs because Chrome’s translation feature is activated due to the foreign-language content. As a result, the user may be unaware of the file download, potentially leading to an unintended download of an unwanted file. A proof-of-concept (PoC) video is provided to demonstrate this behavior.

Summary
Download Notification Obscured by Translation Popup, Leading to Undetected File Downloads

Additional Data
Category: Security
Chrome Channel: Not sure
Regression: N/A

2025-04-20 00-18-24.mp4
2.8 MB
Download
PoC.html
1010 B
View
Download
Comments
All comments
ch...@google.com<ch...@google.com> #2Apr 20, 2025 07:34PM
Setting Priority to P1 to match Severity s2. If this is incorrect, please reset the priority. The automation bot account won't make this change again.

aj...@google.com<aj...@google.com> #3Apr 23, 2025 01:39AM
Thanks for the report. This is not a security vulnerability as the download notification is not a security surface. The user must still go and open the file, and we believe people will not open files they do not remember downloading.

Sending to normal queue for further triage.

ch...@google.com<ch...@google.com> #4Apr 28, 2025 04:39PM
Thank you for reporting the issue. Based on the provided details, we have assigned the appropriate component.

could you please look into this issue. Thanks

